> I'm not aware of any other non-APRS digi software, but you can get 
> ax25digi at:
> 
> ftp://ftp.tapr.org/software_lib/Linux/ax25/ax25digi.tgz

Another choice is digi_ned.  It's extremely flexible, and comes
with a number of sample configuration files.  One of them,
lightly edited, will cause it to act as a very straightforward
single-port generic AX.25 digipeater.

